{{Infobox_Item|title=Snowstorm|image=snowstormeffect.png|type=<span style="color:#FFFFFF">Effect</span>|rarity=[[Common Weapons|<span style="color:magenta;">Godly</span>]]|obtain=[[Christmas Event 2025]] - Buying the [[Snowstorm Bundle]]|theme=godly|tier=N/A|value=N/A}}'''Snowstorm''' is an [[effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Snowstorm Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It is now no longer obtainable as the gamepass has gone offsale
== Appearance ==
The effect surrounds the knife with a white (and a little bit of blue) snowy aura alongside some snow particles. When a victim is killed with this effect, their body will emit an effect similar to the one that surround the knife.

